From a28fdd6ce773a53b2a0002aa0755771dc4010c8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jian-Ming Wang <jian.ming.wang@mitaccomputing.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Feb 2026 06:03:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] 1. Refact powr_control using the lib from 
 phosphor-dbus-yaml. 2. Preset OperatingSystemState whenever BootProgress
 transit to Post Complete or not Post Complete. 3. Support set_property and
 timestamp update mechansim so that phosphor-host-ipmid could use dbus
 interface to change BootProgress. 4. Implement BootProgressStages and
 OperatingSystemOSStatus for PersistentState so that it is possible to restore
 state once BMC reseted.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [No upstream maintenance]
